DESCRIPTION:What happens when a small trigger ignites a big reaction? How can stored energy expand\, move and transform before our eyes? Join us in a fun and safe interactive experience where we observe surprising reactions and share our predictions\, as we explore how energy can remain stored and then burst into rapid and striking transformations.
